# Probe 3: two windows side by side. Alt+C opens C:\ (slot 0, frame at 48,43),
# a double-click on DESKT19 opens C:\DESKT19\ (slot 1, staggered to 72,67 and
# therefore covering it), and a title-bar drag moves the second one down so
# BOTH are visible -- which is what the *Default dir* run needs: the drag then
# goes from the TOP window (C:\DESKT19\) to a program in the window below.
#   C:\ window DESKT19 (431,103)   [probe run 1]
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_CWIN
3100 move 431 103
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4100 parkbr
5000 mark C_SUBWIN
5300 move 300 77
5900 down
6700 drag 300 200
7500 drag 300 308
8300 up
8900 parkbr
9800 mark D_MOVED
11000 pause
